sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>OpenAI/Anthropic SDK
    participant Proxy as Praxis AI Proxy<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Classifier as Classifier Filter
    participant Router as Routing Filter
    participant Translation as Translation Filter
    participant Guardrail as NeMo Guardrails<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Store as Response Store<br/>PostgreSQL 5432/TCP
    participant Backend as Inference Backend<br/>vLLM / Cloud API
    participant Valkey as Valkey/Redis<br/>6379/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,Backend: Flow 1: OpenAI Chat Completions Proxy
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Proxy->>Classifier: Classify request<br/>Sets x-praxis-ai-api-format header
        Classifier->>Router: Route by model/capability<br/>Reads x-praxis-ai-* headers
        Router->>Backend: Forward to inference backend<br/>TLS, Bearer/SigV4
        Backend-->>Proxy: Inference response<br/>SSE stream or JSON
        Proxy->>Valkey: Record token usage<br/>Rate limit check
        Proxy-->>Client: Response<br/>with usage headers
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Client,Backend: Flow 2: Anthropic Messages → Chat Completions Translation
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/messages<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Proxy->>Classifier: Classify as Anthropic Messages
        Classifier->>Translation: anthropic_messages_to_chat_completions<br/>Protocol translation
        Translation->>Guardrail: Pre-inference guardrail check<br/>Content safety
        Guardrail-->>Translation: Allow/Block
        Translation->>Backend: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Translated payload, TLS
        Backend-->>Proxy: Chat Completions response<br/>SSE stream
        Proxy->>Translation: Reverse translate stream<br/>Chat Completions → Messages format
        Proxy-->>Client: Anthropic Messages response<br/>SSE stream
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,Store: Flow 3: OpenAI Responses with Stateful Store
        Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/responses<br/>Auth: Bearer Token, previous_response_id
        Proxy->>Store: Rehydrate previous response<br/>TLS/mTLS, Password/Cert
        Store-->>Proxy: Previous response state
        Proxy->>Translation: responses_to_chat_completions<br/>Build conversation context
        Translation->>Backend: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Full context, TLS
        Backend-->>Proxy: Inference response
        Proxy->>Store: Persist new response<br/>openai_response_store filter
        Proxy-->>Client: OpenAI Response object<br/>with response ID
    end
